    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a cozy, puzzle platformer where you take it slow, going about your day. Not trying to be the greatest or the most innovative, but will sure give you a great time!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864750/extras/a50a824f69978dcc3835713df9424e19.poster.avif?t=1752650155\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864750/extras/a50a824f69978dcc3835713df9424e19.webm?t=1752650155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864750/extras/a50a824f69978dcc3835713df9424e19.mp4?t=1752650155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is centered around a more casual audience! With some hard segments sprinkled in, to challenge your knowledge of the games mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TOUCH OF BRAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a slow game, where you must think of a path to take that will help, where to go, what to choose and what to gain, the glorious prize. A delectable PASTRY\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DONT LET LITTLE TIMMY PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has themes that is not suitable for some audiences. You have been warned</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>ABOUT THIS GAME</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a cozy, puzzle platformer where you take it slow, going about your day. Not trying to be the greatest or the most innovative, but will sure give you a great time!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864750/extras/a50a824f69978dcc3835713df9424e19.poster.avif?t=1752650155\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864750/extras/a50a824f69978dcc3835713df9424e19.webm?t=1752650155\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3864750/extras/a50a824f69978dcc3835713df9424e19.mp4?t=1752650155\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIFFICULTY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is centered around a more casual audience! With some hard segments sprinkled in, to challenge your knowledge of the games mechanics!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A TOUCH OF BRAINS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a slow game, where you must think of a path to take that will help, where to go, what to choose and what to gain, the glorious prize. A delectable PASTRY\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DONT LET LITTLE TIMMY PLAY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game has themes that is not suitable for some audiences. You have been warned</p>",
